===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Roserade|4}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
*'''Poison Ring''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Team Magma vs Team Aqua|Sceptile ex|93}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Magma vs Team Aqua}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

